---
<section class="manifesto">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="kicker" data-io>What this show is</span>
    <h2 data-io>There is such a thing as truth.<br><em>His name is Jesus.</em></h2>
    <span class="scripture" data-io>John 14:6</span>
    <div class="grid">
      <p data-io><span class="num">01 — The lie starts inside.</span>Before a lie shows up in the headlines it shows up in us. <b>You're not enough. Your shame is who you are. Sin isn't real.</b> We start there, because that's where the enemy starts.</p>
      <p data-io><span class="num">02 — Culture is the echo.</span>The same lies get louder in our schools, our screens, our politics and our wallets. <b>We name them in their own words</b> and test them against the facts and the Word.</p>
      <p data-io><span class="num">03 — The gospel wrecks both.</span>Jesus didn't come to make you a better performer or win an election. <b>He came to give life (John 10:10).</b> That's the standard we measure everything by.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
